  "briefing": "Ironwood Trust holds Deccan through its pump station. Reconnect 2 relays, hold the uplink while it broadcasts, then leave by the exit. Expect 12 enemy agents and 5 guards on the streets.",
  "story": "Deccan Uplink: Ironwood Trust runs Deccan from its pump station, and the district only notices when the lights go out. Your team has one night to reconnect the relays, hold the uplink and walk out the exit.",
  "debrief": {
    "success": "Deccan wakes up with the pump station in other hands. Your team is back in the dark before morning.",
    "failure": "The team is down in Deccan before the work was done. Regroup and try a different approach."
  },
